usage: module-nav module [-h] [--permissions] [--dependencies] [--sma] name

positional arguments:
  name            Submodule name (e.g. workbench-wb)

options:
  -h, --help      show this help message and exit
  --permissions   Show only the <permissions> block from module.xml
  --dependencies  Show only the <dependencies> block from module.xml
  --sma           Cross-reference the module with installed license features (SMA-exempt,
                  expiration, feature attributes)
